# BREW Data Processing Utility - Reporter Module

This module generates output reports from processed data.

### Report Contents
- Summary statistics
- Validated record details
- Transformation results
- Error summaries (if any)

### Functionality
- Formats data into human-readable reports
- Writes reports to output files
- Supports basic text formatting

### Usage
Included in the main pipeline. Can be used standalone for reporting.

### Example
```brev
import reporter;

report = reporter.generate(
    processed_records,
    validation_summary,
    transformation_summary
);

reporter.write(report, "report.txt");
```
